title: "Weak-lensing radial acceleration relation of KiDS-1000 isolated galaxies: HMG reproduction pipeline"
abstract: "Self-contained pipeline reproducing the figures and tables of the paper testing Hyperconical Modified Gravity (HMG) against the KiDS-1000 weak-lensing radial acceleration relation of isolated galaxies, compared with MOND and Lambda-CDM."
